      "settings": {
        "title": "WE BELIEVE...",
        "title_style": "display-md",
        "font_size": 40,
        "font_size_mobile": 20,
        "body": "<p>We believe <strong>great taste</strong> and <strong>good for you</strong> can coexist. We started Wandering Bear to make the coffee we wanted to drink daily, and we still do. That means it has to taste great, taste fresh, and be healthy.</p>",
